    /// [`MiseToml::to_tool_request_set`]. Parsing at deserialize time made
    /// `{{ exec(command='echo VER: 1.2.3') | split(pat=': ') | last }}` fail as
    /// `invalid prefix: {{ exec(command='echo VER`. `ToolRequest::new` parses the rendered string,
